# Show Planar Bindings' own item description, including its spell list.
# Reproduction for inc-lqc7; seed 1, options-2026-08-22.dat.
# The acquisition browser highlights its middle row: when the desired book
# first appears at the bottom, one more DOWN selects it (book-stack.keys).
@include chargen.keys

w
@until "Wizard Mode Options" y
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT*7
@until "Spellbook [Planar Bindings]" DOWN
@expect "Spellbook [Planar Bindings]"
DOWN
ENTER
# Examine the item while it is still in the In-the-Air slot.
x
@expect "Spellbook:"
@dump:book-notimp-listing
ESC
s
ESC
@quit
